WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.660
Here's Grok on your phone.

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:05.040
Open the App Store or Google Play and search for Grok.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.560
Check it's the official app from xAI,

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.220
then tap Install.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.890
Open it and sign in, or make a free account.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:13.750
You type your own password.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:18.990
When you see the chat box, come back to our page and tap 'Copy prompt and open Grok'.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.100
Paste it into the chat and send.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.635
Your trainer takes it from there.

